<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia sets A$100 mln indexed bond tender.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia sets A$100 mln indexed bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury said it will offer A$100 million of 4.0 percent August 2020 indexed bonds at a tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>The nominal value of principal is A$101.01.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 12.45 p.m. (0145 GMT) and the result will be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0300 GMT).</p>
<p>Settlement date is November 25.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
